<title>USA: Coastal sets $400 mln notes in 2-part deal.</title>
<headline>Coastal sets $400 mln notes in 2-part deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp issue $400 million notes in a two-tranche deal through Smith Barney Inc via a competitive bid on Tuesday, according to Smith Barney.</p>
<p>BORROWER COASTAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.42 PCT   MATURITY 2/15/2037</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.42 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 83 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 2/15/2027</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 6.70 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
